text = "[b][color=#00e5ff]HISTORICAL & GEOLOGICAL SOURCES:[/color][/b]
• [b]NASA Lunar Sample Compendium[/b] — Samples 70017, 74220, 76015, and 70181 (Meyer, C., NASA JSC).
• [b]Apollo Lunar Surface Journal (ALSJ)[/b] — Authentic mission transcripts & audio telemetry (Jones, E. M., NASA HQ).
• [b]LROC Lunar Reconnaissance Orbiter Camera[/b] — Photometric regolith scattering & digital elevation data (ASU / NASA GSFC).
• [b]Smithsonian 3D Heritage & NASA 3D Resources[/b] — Apollo Lunar Roving Vehicle, Lunar Module Descent Stage, ALSEP array."

